#: templates/admin.php:13
msgid ""
"Use <strong>\"[csl-search pageid=\"your store listing page id\"]\"</strong> "
"shortcode on page for displaying search widget in page where \"your store "
"listing page id\" is page id of store listing page which contains  \"[csl-"
"store-list]\" shortcode. For example, [csl-search pageid=\"5226\"] ."
msgstr ""
"在页面上使用 <strong>[csl-search pageid=\"your store listing page id\"]\"</strong> "
"简码在页面中显示搜索小部件，其中“your store listing page id”是商品详情页面的页面 ID，其中包含“[csl-store-"
"list]”简码。例如，[csl-search pageid=\"5226\"] 。"

#: templates/admin.php:15
msgid ""
"Use <strong>\"[csl-store-list category=\"your category slug\"]\"</strong> "
"shortcode on page for displaying store list along with map for specific "
"category"
msgstr ""
"在页面上使用 <strong>[csl-store-list category=\"your category slug\"]\"</strong> "
"简码显示商店列表以及特定类别的地图"

#: templates/admin.php:11
msgid ""
"Use <strong>\"[csl-store-list]\"</strong> shortcode on page for displaying "
"store list along with map"
msgstr "在页面上使用 <strong>[csl-store-list]\"</strong> 简码来显示商店列表和地图"

